Instruction for use

Before coding or presenting the platform as compliant, refresh every policy and legal source, obtain the university’s approved academic and financial rules, confirm the institution’s NCHE status and program approvals, and document decisions with the Registrar, Finance/Bursar, ICT, Student Affairs, academic leadership, and institutional counsel or designated compliance lead.